# Plugin Behaviours

## Plugin Lifecycle

```elixir
@behaviour BfwEngine.Plugin
@callback on_load(facade :: struct()) :: :ok | {:error, term()}
@callback on_ready(facade :: struct()) :: :ok | {:error, term()}
```

## ServiceTaskHandler

Unique by `implementation`. Handles Service Task dispatch by `implementation` attribute. Always asynchronous.

```elixir
@behaviour BfwEngine.Plugin.ServiceTaskHandler
@callback handle_enter(flow_node, token, handler_context) ::
  {:async, String.t()} | {:error, term()}
```

## EventSink

Many allowed. Receives engine events.

```elixir
@behaviour BfwEngine.Plugin.EventSink
@callback init(opts :: keyword()) :: {:ok, state} | {:error, term()}
@callback accepts?(event :: struct()) :: boolean()
@callback handle_event(event, state) :: {:ok, state} | :skip
@callback handle_shutdown(state) :: :ok
```

## RestApiExtension

Mounted under prefix. Reserved prefixes (including `/escalations`) are rejected.

```elixir
@behaviour BfwEngine.Plugin.RestApiExtension
@callback router_module() :: module()
```

## NamedScript

Unique by script_key. Handles `bfw:scriptRef` dispatch. Always synchronous.

```elixir
@behaviour BfwEngine.Plugin.NamedScript
@callback handle_enter(flow_node :: map(), payload :: map(), context :: map()) ::
  {:ok, map()} | {:error, term()}
```

## AuthProvider

Unique (singleton, first-writer wins). Replaces the built-in JWT verifier.

```elixir
@behaviour BfwEngine.Plugin.AuthProvider
@callback verify_and_resolve(token :: String.t()) ::
  {:ok, Identity.t()} | {:error, term()}
```

PersistenceAdapter, MonitoringPanel, TimerSource, and DataStoreAdapter plugin capabilities do not exist.
